     H/COPY QRPGLESRC,HSPEC
     FMYFILE    IF   E           K DISK
     D Name            S             20A
     D Count           S              5I 0
     C     *IN01         IFEQ      *ON
     C                   ADD       1             Count
     C                   MOVEL     'HELLO'       Name
     C                   ENDIF
     C     Name          DSPLY
     C                   SETON                                        LR
